{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101977","id":2296025120,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6I2pAg","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101977","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101977.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101977.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101977","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101977/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101977/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101977/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/cef942ad4ecb199989e92de6a9e8df23c480fb81","number":101977,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"[Android] Support HDR output","user":{"login":"DarkKilauea","id":1929107,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MjkxMDc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1929107?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkKilauea","html_url":"https://github.com/DarkKilauea","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkKilauea/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkKilauea/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkKilauea/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkKilauea/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkKilauea/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkKilauea/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkKilauea/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkKilauea/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkKilauea/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Based on #94496 \r\nImplements https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/10817 for Android\r\nTesting/Sample project: https://github.com/DarkKilauea/godot-hdr-output\r\n\r\nAdds support for rendering HDR output on Android devices, should only be merged after #94496. See the last commit for android specific details.\r\n\r\nHDR 10 support is added back in via this PR due to my Android devices requiring it in order to show an HDR output. Looking at https://developer.android.com/reference/android/view/Display.HdrCapabilities it doesn't look like there is any support for HDR output via a linear Rec 709 color space.\r\n\r\nKnown issues:\r\n- ~Forward Mobile seems to squash the dynamic range too much to really show the \"HDR effect\".~\r\n- ~SDR white level is a guess due to the lack of APIs to get the actual value. Works well on the Pixel phones I have.~\r\n- ~Not sure if `Window.setColorMode` is actually necessary to get HDR output to show.~\r\n- Binding Java methods in Godot is new to me, so they may not be correct or may be bound in the wrong classes.\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097562,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1NjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:android","name":"platform:android","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/g